   "notes": "Recipe recovered from Gaimster et al. 2016, which reproduces verbatim the same defined P. denitrificans succinate/nitrate chemostat medium used by Felgate et al. 2012 (the base-medium reference cited by the modeling paper PMC3831637). All 12 trace/salt concentrations already in the record match a 500x (2 mL/L) dilution of the Vishniac & Santer stock exactly. The two previously uncovered compounds (Na2HPO4 buffer, EDTA chelator) are confirmed real and now included. This is the high-copper variant (full CuSO4 = 12.8 umol/L ~ the paper's 13 umol/L); the low-copper variant instead omits/chelates C"
